Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:58:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 06/17] lakeside v3.3 prewarm: warm
 bundle/transforms/prefabs/water material when the lake chapter opens
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Opening the 风铃湖畔 chapter card (only when its gate is open) starts
prewarmLakesideAssets(): bundle, transforms JSON, every prefab and the
water material are loaded and addRef'd, so the first entry does no
network/decode/upload work. The lease drops the prewarm refs after taking
its own; unused prewarm is released after 120 s. Failures only log.
Shader variants are not precompiled: lake entry flips the fog macro
(island fog off -> lake LAYERED), so a pre-entry compile would hit the
wrong variant.

Test: tools/lakeside/test_lakeside_prewarm.cjs (suite: lakeside-prewarm).
(cherry picked from commit 888daeb803e09d59528c84207b6957c14f8d3535)
